OL,4,BOxford beat Spurs U21s to seal EFL     
OL,5,BTrophy progress                        
OL,6,GAaron Ramsey's Oxford United beat      
OL,7,GTottenham Hotspur Under-21s 2-1 to     
OL,8,Gsecure one of the final two Jersey     
OL,9,GMike's Trophy knockout spots.          
OL,11,FOxford knew avoiding defeat by a       
OL,12,Fmargin of four goals or more would be  
OL,13,Fenough to seal progression from        
OL,14,FSouthern Group A alongside already-    
OL,15,Fqualified Exeter City.                 
OL,17,FThey trailed to Tyler Tingey's early   
OL,18,Fopener on Tuesday, which gave Spurs'   
OL,19,Fyoungsters a glimmer of hope of        
OL,20,Fpulling off that mini-miracle.         
